        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we are required to comply with federal, state and international laws, regulations and other standards designed to protect personal data, including the California Consumer Protection Act (\"CCPA\"), the GDPR (as defined below), the Payment Card Industry (“PCI”) and Data Security Standard (\"DSS\"), which govern privacy and the storing, sharing, use, disclosure and protection of personally identifiable information and user data, an area that is increasingly subject to legislation and regulations in numerous jurisdictions.",
        "start_character": 7737,
        "end_character": 8271
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014844",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014844-2831c38ab4fabf6e",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014844",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, the application and interpretation of these laws and regulations often are uncertain, particularly in the rapidly evolving industry in which we operate.",
        "start_character": 11387,
        "end_character": 11552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014844",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014844-2831c38ab4fabf6e",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014844",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Protecting our intellectual property can be costly and time consuming given the expanse of jurisdictions in which we operate, and third-party infringement claims may arise from time to time.",
        "start_character": 5627,
        "end_character": 5817
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-014844",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-014844-2831c38ab4fabf6e",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-014844",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe we operate the largest global secondary ticketing marketplace for live events.",
